                <![CDATA[
                    
                    <p>天猫【Gosund 旗舰店】</p><p>酷客智能“电小酷”<a class="s_tag" href="https://iphone.ithome.com/" target="_blank">iPhone</a> 充电配件今日开启限时狂清，日常 19.9 元，叠加 5 元单品券 + 9.95 元淘金币补贴后，仅需 4.9 元即可入手：</p><dir><a contenteditable="false" href="https://uland.taobao.com/coupon/edetail?e=%2FIh8ldsiXBalhHvvyUNXZfh8CuWt5YH5OVuOuRD5gLJMmdsrkidbOWBzzpT26idJkIVXKIMx7r1wLITLar%2FktAN4mvHoIB20vZ9CV1D6mtpjTS4nhqLStpNLMv3K5V8f2mwCY5fS7rVrTdT7cgXf6jgYSYpxmYtMsb%2Bvi71p7YhlXymvoVZzQ%2FOfYMznYJWPoygxEw%2BidAmWxb%2F4IJHyBxHtR5M9fhgNtsfGA5CFJLDe4LCSMIu01HLmoMDXvnqU7jKjAO7pxYgdIMeVz1KiUX4%2BWynxxEENlxu4FvvJPMl%2BHrLNCkR4%2Fnn3owwvt7SKSzs%2FyXYWFXSuTmgRnC%2FRkkwNBUbTsArs&amp;traceId=215045cf17887641654533778e0b41&amp;&amp;union_lens=lensId:TAPI@1788764165@21278f5e_13f0_1a07aa71595_7ec5@01" target="_blank"><span class="card main-site"><span class="card-logo"><img height="800" src="https://img.alicdn.com/bao/uploaded/i2/2200824632280/O1CN01OrgWdPZDLED1chua_!!4611686018427384792-0-item_pic.jpg" title="20W 快充头 / Lightning 苹果线 19.9 → 4.9 元，电小酷 iPhone 充电配件狂清" width="800" /></span><span class="card-info"><span class="card-title"><span class="mall-data">天猫</span><span class="card-name">电小酷 20W 充电头 / 数据线</span></span><span class="card-abstract">头 + 线套装 9.95 元</span><span class="card-controls"><span class="price">双重优惠 4.9 元</span><span class="card-btn-deep">领 5 元券</span></span></span></span></a></dir><p>此系列可能于 2022 年生产，介意慎拍。</p><p>Lightning 数据线支持 iPhone 5~14 系列，比较适合给家里长辈囤两根。</p><p>如果下单价格不对，可点击宝贝详情页<strong>“淘金币大额补贴”橙色横幅</strong>下单。</p><p>酷客智能国内品牌为“电小酷”，出海品牌为“Gosund”。</p><p>Gosund 的 WiFi 智能插座与空调伴侣都比较出名，之家应该有不少小伙伴都有使用过，口碑还可以。</p><p>充电器支持 PD3.0、PD2.0、QC4.0+/QC4.0/QC3.0/QC2.0、Apple2.4、BC1.2、Huawei FCP / SCP、Samsung AFC、MTK PE 等快充协议。</p><p>不支持 oppo、vivo 私有协议；支持 iPhone8 及以上系列的苹果手机、<a class="s_tag" href="https://ipad.ithome.com/" target="_blank">iPad</a>、华为、三星、小米等品牌主流机型。</p><p style="text-align: center;"><img height="1269" src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/2200824632280/O1CN01J6XXXaGeNBD32pY6_!!22008246322